Package: cec-musiccast-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, udev
Description: control Yamaha MusicCast receivers using HDMI-CEC
 Presents an HDMI-CEC audio system to a television and forwards power,
 input and volume commands to a Yamaha MusicCast receiver. Discovers
 receivers using SSDP and can select a stable device ID across IP changes.
 Includes configuration, a systemd service and device permission rules.
